ttery</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Battery Charger</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Joystick Controller</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Bluetooth Remote Control</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>User Manual</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Tool Kit</li></ul></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-delivery" id="_R_hl_-panel-delivery" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground"><p>Free UK mainland delivery on all XSTO wheelchairs. Typically arrives within 3–4 working days.</p><p>Warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts, and 1 year on the battery. Bentech Medical Ltd manages all UK warranty claims as the official distributor.</p></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm"><a href="/pages/returns" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Read our returns policy</a> · <a href="/pages/warranty" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Warranty information</a></p></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-faq" id="_R_hl_-panel-faq" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-soft"><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Why choose the XSTO M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 is XSTO&#x27;s popular smart electric chair featuring self-balancing technology for stability, foldable design for compact storage, adjustable seat height (347–650 mm), 10° slope capability, omnidirectional mecanum wheels enabling 360° rotation, app-based remote control, and detachable 4-module quick disassembly ideal for travel.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4 be used on grass, sand, or gravel?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes! Its robust tyres and powerful motor handle grass, packed sand, and gravel effectively. For loose sand or rough ground, reduce speed to maintain stability.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What is the M4&#x27;s maximum weight capacity?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 supports up to 115 kg (254 lbs) and maintains stable performance within this limit for safe operation.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How long does the M4 battery last on a single charge?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Under typical daily use (regular speed, moderate terrain), the standard 25.55V 15.5Ah battery provides up to 15 km (9.3 miles) per charge. Full recharge takes approximately 4 hours.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4 be taken on flights?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 includes a standard 25.55V 15.5Ah removable battery. For air travel, a compatible lower-capacity airline battery (sold separately) is recommended. While that battery meets most airline requirements, please confirm with your airline before flying.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How soon can I receive the M4 after ordering?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What warranty is included with the M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I claim VAT relief on the M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4 VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout.</p></details></div></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-videos" id="_R_hl_-panel-videos" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-secondary shadow-soft"><iframe loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowFullScreen="" class="size-full border-0 object-contain" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/D-7Pt3OUdQg" title="Watch the M4 in Action"></iframe></div><p class="font-medium text-foreground">Watch the M4 in Action</p></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-label="XSTO M4 reviews" class="mt-12 border-t border-border pt-10 md:mt-14 md:pt-12" id="reviews"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"><div><p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-navy/70">Customer reviews</p><h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] tex